Package: libxmlb2
Version: @DEB_LIBXMLB_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/hughsie/libxmlb
Depends: libglib2.0-0, liblzma5
Description: Library to help create and query binary XML blobs
 libxmlb is a library to create and query compressed binary XML blobs, used by
 AppStream. This package contains the shared library.
